{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292260","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029226001:0":{"text":"이 멍청한 탈영병 놈들! 지금 너희들이 하는 짓이 전혀 부끄럽지 않은가!","source_cn":"你们这些愚蠢的逃兵！难道就一点也不为自己的行为感到羞愧吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C017E0806125206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029226002:0":{"text":"샤, 샤키르가 어떻게 여기에... 설마 계획이 틀통났나?! 어느 놈이 배신한 거야?!","source_cn":"什、什么！沙奎尔怎么会在这里……难道我们的计划暴露了？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE91B537D2CE6229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029226003:2":{"text":"말도 안 돼. 서로 탓하는 건 그만두고 샤키르에게서 도망갈 방법을 찾아야 해...","source_cn":"不可能。先别忙着互相责怪，还是想想怎么从沙奎尔眼皮下面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC350DAEAA6C02D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029226004:0":{"text":"도망? 흥, 내 눈에 들어온 이상 아무도 도망칠 수 없다!","source_cn":"逃跑？哼，既然已经被我找到了，你们一个都别想逃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F68AACD038A9640","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"샤키르","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:愤怒的盗宝贼":{"text":"화난 보물 도둑","source":"愤怒的盗宝贼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:烦躁的盗宝贼":{"text":"초조한 보물 도둑","source":"烦躁的盗宝贼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow